{"id":"faf104362ffe13b3","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","title":"Elementary Substructure","display":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary Substructure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-elementary-substructure","aliases":["58-df-elementary-substructure"],"display":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary Substructure","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-elementary-substructure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-elementary-substructure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary Substructure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md\">../batch09/58-df-elementary.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V\">\\(L,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (canonical elementary-substructure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md\">../batch09/58-df-elementary.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_L\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\prec_L\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (elementary-substructure relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash \\mathcal M\\prec_L\\mathcal N\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash \\mathcal M\\prec_L\\mathcal N\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The notation is an exact alias of the canonical assignment-based predicate; it does not apply the upstream satisfaction relation to an unencoded parameter tuple.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} \\prec \\mathcal{N}\">\\(\\mathcal{M} \\prec \\mathcal{N}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{N}\">\\(\\mathcal{N}\\)</span> 的初等子结构</li>\n<li>等价于：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} \\subseteq \\mathcal{N}\">\\(\\mathcal{M} \\subseteq \\mathcal{N}\\)</span> 且对所有公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 和赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} \\models \\varphi[s] \\iff \\mathcal{N} \\models \\varphi[s]\">\\(\\mathcal{M} \\models \\varphi[s] \\iff \\mathcal{N} \\models \\varphi[s]\\)</span></li>\n<li>初等嵌入：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j: \\mathcal{M} \\to \\mathcal{N}\">\\(j: \\mathcal{M} \\to \\mathcal{N}\\)</span> 是初等嵌入当且仅当\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} \\models \\varphi[a_1,\\ldots,a_n] \\iff \\mathcal{N} \\models \\varphi[j(a_1),\\ldots,j(a_n)]\">\\(\\mathcal{M} \\models \\varphi[a_1,\\ldots,a_n] \\iff \\mathcal{N} \\models \\varphi[j(a_1),\\ldots,j(a_n)]\\)</span></li>\n<li>记号：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} \\prec \\mathcal{N}\">\\(\\mathcal{M} \\prec \\mathcal{N}\\)</span> 也写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} \\preceq \\mathcal{N}\">\\(\\mathcal{M} \\preceq \\mathcal{N}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} \\preccurlyeq \\mathcal{N}\">\\(\\mathcal{M} \\preccurlyeq \\mathcal{N}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Theorem-Connection\">[Theorem Connection]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"33fad5560e7fe384\" href=\"?note=33fad5560e7fe384\" title=\"../batch12/58-thm-loewenheim-skolem.md\">../batch12/58-thm-loewenheim-skolem.md</a> (Löwenheim-Skolem 定理)</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4688aa29fe8d9aa9\" href=\"?note=4688aa29fe8d9aa9\" title=\"../batch15/58-thm-elementary-chain.md\">../batch15/58-thm-elementary-chain.md</a> (初等链定理)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory, Chapter 12 (Model Theory background)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Theorem-Connection","text":"[Theorem Connection]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-elementary.md","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (canonical elementary-substructure predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-elementary.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-thm-loewenheim-skolem.md","status":"resolved","id":"33fad5560e7fe384","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Theorem Connection]","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-loewenheim-skolem.md]] (Löwenheim-Skolem 定理)","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-thm-elementary-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"4688aa29fe8d9aa9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Theorem Connection]","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-thm-elementary-chain.md]] (初等链定理)","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_L\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash \\mathcal M\\prec_L\\mathcal N\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M} \\prec \\mathcal{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M} \\subseteq \\mathcal{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M} \\models \\varphi[s] \\iff \\mathcal{N} \\models \\varphi[s]","display":false},{"tex":"j: \\mathcal{M} \\to \\mathcal{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M} \\models \\varphi[a_1,\\ldots,a_n] \\iff \\mathcal{N} \\models \\varphi[j(a_1),\\ldots,j(a_n)]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M} \\prec \\mathcal{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M} \\preceq \\mathcal{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M} \\preccurlyeq \\mathcal{N}","display":false}],"bytes":1738,"backlinks":[{"id":"82c66a91c89d5dee","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"42db21ac702cc072","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"665cb44847f02c61","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\prec_{\\mathcal L}$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]])"},{"id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\prec_{\\mathcal L}$ (elementary-substruct